{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48190","headline":"江亭晚望题书斋 · 陈季卿","name":"江亭晚望题书斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"立向江亭满目愁，十年前事信悠悠。\n田园已逐浮云散，乡里半随逝水流。\n川上莫逢诸钓叟，浦边难得旧沙鸥。\n不缘齿发未迟暮，吟对远山堪白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈季卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}